      "lines": [
        "(ICML, 2015)",
        "“Encouraged by recent advances in caption generation and inspired by recent success in employing attention",
        "in machine translation (Bahdanau et al., 2014) and object recognition (Ba et al., 2014; Mnih et al., 2014), we",
        "investigate models that can attend to salient part of an image while generating its caption.”"
