      "lines": [
        "Architecture",
        "Attention module:",
        "determines each input’s",
        "relevance for prediction",
        "Decoder: at each",
        "time step, 2-layer",
        "LSTM used to",
        "predict a character",
        "Encoder: converts feature vector sampled from",
        "the input (40-d log-mel filter bank features",
        "computed every 10ms) into hidden states;",
        "much longer speech sequences necessitated",
        "innovation (e.g., pyramid) to compress input"
      ]
    },
