      "lines": [
        "Training (Took ~2 Weeks)",
        "• Dataset: ~3M Google voice search examples/utterances (~2000 hours of data)",
        "• Weight initialization: Uniform distribution from -0.1 to 0.1",
        "• Optimizer: SGD with learning weight decay throughout training",
        "• Batch size: 32 utterances",
        "• Data augmentation: 20x increase by introducing various noise sources",
        "• Decoding with beam search: beam width of 32"
      ]
    },
